CM_ BO_ 1098 "EPRI ID ERROR: plist predicted 0x459 (wrong -0x020 offset from GENE 0x479); actual ID is 0x44A (-0x02F offset). 0x459 has zero frames in all captured logs. Symmetric to GENE 0x0479. B3 is a rolling counter.";
CM_ SG_ 1098 TRAC_DrvCoolFlowReq_pct "Inverter (drive) cooling flow request. Symmetric to GENE_DrvCoolFlowReq_pct (0x0479 B0). Scale assumed by structural symmetry.";
CM_ SG_ 1098 TRAC_MotCoolFlowReq_pct "Saturates at 100% under sustained traction thermal stress.";
CM_ SG_ 1098 TRAC_ThermInd_pct "r=+1.000 vs 0x06000002 B5/B6 (PT bus VCU re-broadcast). B3 is a rolling counter -- not a signal.";
CM_ BO_ 1090 "TRAC MCU traction torque feedback. OBD bus. Symmetric to 0x471 (GENE torque feedback, PT bus). epri-obd-bus.dbc incorrectly names 0x451 as TRAC_Mot_Trq (0x451 is GMLAN Gateway_LS_General_Information). B6 is a rolling counter.";
CM_ SG_ 1090 TRAC_TrqFbk "Positive = motoring; regen = negative. B3, B5=status bytes. B6=rolling counter. Scale 0.125 Nm/count unconfirmed (assumed symmetric to 0x471).";
